msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "页面区块"

msgid "Home sections"
msgstr "首页区块"

msgid "Query templates for the front page, in listed order: a heading row (icon + title, \"more\" link at the right) over a list of posts. The front end resolves each section against its public list reads; rows without a title are skipped."
msgstr "按列表顺序生成首页的查询模板：一行标题（图标 + 标题，右侧为「更多」链接）下列出帖子。前端按各区块配置调用公开列表读取自行解析；未填标题的行会被跳过。"

msgid "These lists replace the WordPress menu system and feed the shell's dynamic slots: the front end reads them through the `blocks` group of GET /aiya/core/v1/site, rows in listed order."
msgstr "这些列表替代 WordPress 菜单系统，并填充壳层的动态槽位：前台经 GET /aiya/core/v1/site 的 `blocks` 组按列表顺序读取。"

msgid "Primary menu"
msgstr "主菜单"

msgid "The main navigation of the front-end shell (site header). Internal targets are front-end paths (/posts/), external ones absolute https URLs."
msgstr "前台外壳的主导航（页头）。站内目标填前台路径（/posts/），外部目标填完整的 https URL。"

msgid "Secondary menu"
msgstr "次菜单"

msgid "The auxiliary navigation of the front-end shell (footer, legal links). Same rules as the primary menu."
msgstr "前台外壳的辅助导航（页脚、法务链接）。规则同主菜单。"

msgid "Page-top advertisements"
msgstr "页面顶部广告"

msgid "Ad slots rendered at the top of front-end pages, in listed order."
msgstr "在前台页面顶部按列表顺序渲染的广告位。"

msgid "Page-bottom advertisements"
msgstr "页面底部广告"

msgid "Ad slots rendered at the bottom of front-end pages, in listed order."
msgstr "在前台页面底部按列表顺序渲染的广告位。"

msgid "Front-end path (/posts/) or external URL; empty falls back to the home path."
msgstr "前台路径（/posts/）或外部 URL；留空回退到首页路径。"

msgid "Icon"
msgstr "图标"

msgid "Optional Lucide icon name for the sidebar (e.g. \"home\", \"image\", \"file-text\")."
msgstr "侧边栏使用的可选 Lucide 图标名（如 \"home\"、\"image\"、\"file-text\"）。"

msgid "Open in"
msgstr "打开方式"

msgid "Same window"
msgstr "当前窗口"

msgid "New window"
msgstr "新窗口"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "链接"

msgid "Front-end path or external URL; empty renders the banner without a link."
msgstr "前台路径或外部 URL；留空则横幅不带链接。"

msgid "Link text"
msgstr "链接文本"

msgid "Also used as the banner image alt text."
msgstr "同时用作横幅图的替代文本。"

msgid "Ad image"
msgstr "广告图"

msgid "The banner artwork from the media library."
msgstr "来自媒体库的横幅图。"

msgid "Optional Lucide icon name beside the title (e.g. \"newspaper\", \"flame\", \"star\")."
msgstr "标题旁可选的 Lucide 图标名（如 \"newspaper\"、\"flame\"、\"star\"）。"

msgid "Content type"
msgstr "内容类型"

msgid "Categories"
msgstr "分类"

msgid "Nothing checked shows every category of the type; the listed vocabularies cover posts and resources alike."
msgstr "全部不勾选即展示该类型的所有分类；所列词法同时覆盖文章与资源。"

msgid "Post count"
msgstr "帖子数量"

msgid "How many posts the section lists (1-100)."
msgstr "该区块列出的帖子数量（1-100）。"

msgid "\"More\" link"
msgstr "「更多」链接"

msgid "Optional override for the heading row's link; empty derives the type's own archive path (with the chosen categories)."
msgstr "可选的标题行链接覆盖值；留空时按类型自动派生归档路径（含所选分类）。"

msgid "Operational content settings: retention periods, the site-level SEO head values served through GET /aiya/core/v1/site, and the NSFW vocabularies the read path can exclude on request."
msgstr "内容运营设置：保留期限、经 GET /aiya/core/v1/site 供前台使用的站点级 SEO 头部信息，以及读路径可按要求排除的 NSFW 词法。"

msgid "Retention policy"
msgstr "保留策略"

msgid "Notification retention (days)"
msgstr "通知保留期（天）"

msgid "A daily cleanup removes stored notifications older than this many days."
msgstr "每日清理任务会删除超过该天数的站内通知。"

msgid "Ledger retention (days)"
msgstr "账本保留期（天）"

msgid "How long closed credit history (spent rows, emptied buckets) is kept before the daily cleanup removes it. Live unexpired buckets are never touched."
msgstr "已关闭的积分历史（消费流水、已扣空的桶）在每日清理前的保留时长。未过期的有效桶不受影响。"

msgid "SEO & analytics"
msgstr "SEO 与统计"

msgid "SEO keywords"
msgstr "SEO 关键词"

msgid "Comma-separated keywords for the site home page."
msgstr "站点首页的关键词，英文逗号分隔。"

msgid "SEO description"
msgstr "SEO 描述"

msgid "Meta description for the site home page."
msgstr "站点首页的 meta 描述。"

msgid "Google Analytics ID"
msgstr "Google Analytics ID"

msgid "Measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX); the front end renders the analytics snippet from it. Leave empty to disable."
msgstr "衡量 ID（如 G-XXXXXXXXXX），前端据此渲染统计脚本；留空则不启用。"

msgid "NSFW filter"
msgstr "NSFW 过滤"

msgid "Terms picked here count as NSFW: the front end asks for them to be dropped from listings (any matching category excludes the post). Untouched by default — detail pages and direct archive visits stay reachable, and a signed-in user with \"always show NSFW content\" ignores the filter."
msgstr "勾选的术语即视为 NSFW：前台可要求把它们从列表中排除（命中任意一个分类即排除该文章）。默认不生效——详情页与直接访问的分类页仍可达，开启「始终显示 NSFW 内容」的登录用户不受过滤影响。"

msgid "NSFW terms — %s"
msgstr "NSFW 术语——%s"

msgid "Every picked term is treated as NSFW content for this type; posts carrying any of them drop out of requested listings."
msgstr "勾选的术语将按该内容类型的 NSFW 内容处理；命中其中任意一个的文章都会从按要求过滤的列表中排除。"

msgid "Content management"
msgstr "内容管理"

msgid "Resource"
msgstr "资源"

msgid "Original work"
msgstr "原作"

msgid "Characters"
msgstr "角色"

msgid "Content description"
msgstr "内容描述"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "前台设置"

msgid "AIYA CMS Core"
msgstr "AIYA CMS Core"

msgid "These fields feed the front-end shell through GET /aiya/core/v1/site; leave a footer string empty to keep it out of the footer."
msgstr "这些字段通过 GET /aiya/core/v1/site 提供给前台外壳；页脚字符串留空即不在页脚显示。"

msgid "Basic settings"
msgstr "基础设置"

msgid "Frontend domain"
msgstr "前台域名"

msgid "The canonical front-end origin including the scheme, for example https://www.example.com. When set, password-reset links always point here; more front-end-facing features will reuse this value. Leave empty to keep reset links on this site address."
msgstr "前台站点的完整来源地址（含协议，例如 https://www.example.com）。设置后密码重置链接一律指向此处，后续前台相关功能也会复用该值；留空则重置链接回退到本站点地址。"

msgid "Front-end language"
msgstr "前台语言"

msgid "The interface language signed-out visitors start with; signed-in members override it from their account settings. Auto follows the WordPress site language."
msgstr "未登录访客的默认界面语言；已登录成员可在账户设置中另行选择。Auto 跟随 WordPress 站点语言。"

msgid "Auto (site language)"
msgstr "自动（跟随站点语言）"

msgid "Presentation defaults"
msgstr "外观默认值"

msgid "Theme color"
msgstr "主题色"

