msgstr "卡片封面缺失时使用：列表卡片缩略图与分类卡片——各表面从这一张图派生自己的裁剪。文章头图在下方有独立默认值。"

msgid "Default article hero"
msgstr "文章头图默认图"

msgid "The banner crop served as the article hero for posts whose author did not set a featured image. Leave unset to let those heroes fall back to the card cover chain instead."
msgstr "作者未设置特色图片的文章，其头图使用本图的横幅裁剪。留空则这些文章的头图回落到卡片封面链。"

msgid "Empty state image"
msgstr "空状态图片"

msgid "Placeholder shown on empty lists and error cards across the front end."
msgstr "前台空列表与错误卡片上显示的占位图。"

msgid "Header banner"
msgstr "头部横幅"

msgid "Show the header banner"
msgstr "显示头部横幅"

msgid "Turns the compact top bar into a tall header backed by the banner image."
msgstr "将紧凑顶栏变为以横幅图作背景的高头部。"

msgid "Banner image"
msgstr "横幅图片"

