msgstr "自定义图标地址"

msgid "Used when the icon template is set to custom."
msgstr "图标模板选择自定义时使用。"

msgid "Slug generation"
msgstr "别名生成"

msgid "Post slug generation"
msgstr "文章别名生成"

msgid "Pinyin fills empty slugs from the title; the ID modes force an ID-based slug on every save."
msgstr "拼音模式仅为空别名按标题补全；ID 模式在每次保存时强制使用基于 ID 的别名。"

