msgstr "名称拼音"

msgid "Free-form text; the front end resolves it into an icon."
msgstr "自由文本，前台将其解析为图标。"

msgid "Custom appearance"
msgstr "自定义外观"

msgid "Used by the headless front end for this term's archive page."
msgstr "无头前端在此术语的归档页使用这些信息。"

msgid "Cover image"
msgstr "封面图"

msgid "Upload or pick an image from the media library; it serves as the cover of the term archive page."
msgstr "上传或从媒体库选择图片，作为术语归档页的封面。"

msgid "Used by the headless front end wherever this term shows up."
msgstr "前台在该术语出现的任何位置使用。"

msgid "Check-in is not available."
msgstr "签到功能未开放。"

msgid "Already checked in today."
msgstr "今天已签到。"

msgid "Daily check-in"
msgstr "每日签到"

msgid "Signed-in users claim a small daily credit grant from the front end."
msgstr "登录用户可在前台每日领取一小笔积分。"

msgid "Check-in grant"
msgstr "签到发放额"

msgid "Credits added per check-in; 0 disables granting."
msgstr "每次签到加入的积分；0 表示不发放。"

msgid "Credit validity (days)"
msgstr "积分有效期（天）"

msgid "How long a check-in grant stays spendable. Credits are cost accounting, not savings — every grant expires."
msgstr "签到发放的积分可使用的时长。积分是成本计量，不是存款——每笔发放都会过期。"

msgid "Spend waiver"
msgstr "消费免扣"

msgid "Waived holder level"
msgstr "免扣用户级别"

msgid "Holders at this role level or above spend at zero on every consumer — downloads included — while the ledger still records the entry and the download meter still counts the delivery. The ledger books the waived spend as a zero-credit entry, so the giveaway stays visible. Staff roles only: subscribers and contributors always pay."
msgstr "此级别及以上的用户在所有消费场景按 0 分入账（含下载交付）：账本照常记录条目，下载计量照常计数，赠送去向保持可见。仅覆盖管理侧角色，订阅者与投稿者始终正常扣费"

msgid "Author and above"
msgstr "作者及以上"

msgid "Editor and above"
msgstr "编辑及以上"

msgid "Administrator only"
msgstr "仅管理员"

