msgstr "该内容不支持计数。"

msgid "Folder id or share code"
msgstr "文件夹 ID 或分享码"

msgid "The GoFile folder this list shows. Reading it through the API needs a Premium account on the token from the file downloads settings page."
msgstr "这个列表展示的 GoFile 文件夹。通过 API 读取它需要在「文件下载」设置页填写的令牌属于高级版账号。"

