msgstr "要展示其文件的目录；留空则不启用这个列表。"

msgid "The password of that directory on the OpenList side, if any. Kept readable: every request re-sends it."
msgstr "OpenList 侧该目录的密码（如有）。因每次请求都要重发，故保持明文可读。"

msgid "Drive share"
msgstr "网盘分享"

msgid "Share link"
msgstr "分享链接"

