msgid "A text snippet the reader copies with one click."
msgstr "供读者一键复制的文本片段。"

msgid "Reference"
msgstr "关联号"

msgid "Emits one semantic reference marker for the front end to resolve into a link. Fill exactly one of the fields below; when several are filled the first (post, user, term, search, comment, thread) wins."
msgstr "输出一个语义引用标记，由前台解析为链接。以下字段只填一个；若填写多个，按（文章、用户、分类法、搜索、评论、社区帖）顺序取第一个生效。"

msgid "Post ID"
msgstr "文章 ID"

msgid "Term ID"
msgstr "分类法术语 ID"

msgid "Search keywords"
msgstr "搜索关键词"

msgid "Comment ID"
msgstr "评论 ID"

msgid "Thread ID"
msgstr "社区帖 ID"

msgid "Typography tools"
msgstr "排版工具"

msgid "Refresh the publish date to now"
msgstr "将发布日期刷新为当前时间"

msgid "Match existing tags against the content"
msgstr "按正文内容匹配已有标签"

msgid "Clean up legacy HTML (div/center/span, overlapping tags)"
msgstr "清理旧式 HTML（div/center/span 与重叠标签）"

msgid "Run the Chinese typesetting pass"
msgstr "执行中文排版纠正"

msgid "Chinese typesetting"
msgstr "中文排版"

msgid "Enabled typesetting correctors"
msgstr "启用的排版纠正项"

msgid "Applied to the title and the content on the Chinese typesetting pass."
msgstr "中文排版纠正时应用于标题与正文。"

msgid "Insert spaces between CJK and Latin/digits"
msgstr "在中英文与数字之间插入空格"

msgid "Remove spaces around fullwidth punctuation"
msgstr "去除全角标点周围的空格"

msgid "Fullwidth letters, digits and symbols to halfwidth"
msgstr "全角字母、数字与符号转半角"

msgid "Fix incorrect punctuation"
msgstr "修复错误的标点符号"

msgid "Correct proper-noun casing"
msgstr "修正专有名词大小写"

msgid "Strip class attributes"
msgstr "去除 class 属性"

msgid "Strip id attributes"
msgstr "去除 id 属性"

msgid "Strip style attributes"
msgstr "去除 style 属性"

msgid "Remove empty paragraph tags"
msgstr "移除空的段落标签"

msgid "Remove all empty tags"
msgstr "移除所有空标签"

msgid "Remove paragraph indentation"
msgstr "移除段首缩进"

msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "优化"

msgid "Stripping is enforced at runtime; REST reads for content stay available for the Astro front end."
msgstr "裁剪在运行时强制执行；内容相关的 REST 读取仍对 Astro 前端可用。"

msgid "Disabled features"
msgstr "已禁用功能"

msgid "Block editor (Gutenberg)"
msgstr "区块编辑器（Gutenberg）"

msgid "Force the classic editor for every post type"
msgstr "为所有文章类型强制使用经典编辑器"

msgid "Block widgets"
msgstr "区块小工具"

msgid "Revert the widgets screen to the classic interface"
msgstr "将小工具屏幕恢复为经典界面"

msgid "Site editor and menus"
msgstr "站点编辑器与菜单"

msgid "Remove the site editor and menus screens and block direct access"
msgstr "移除站点编辑器与菜单屏幕并阻止直接访问"

msgid "The customizer and themes screens stay available for the shell theme."
msgstr "定制器与主题屏幕保持可用，供壳主题使用。"

msgid "Font library and global styles"
msgstr "字体库与全局样式"

msgid "Remove the font library screen and the font/global-style REST routes"
msgstr "移除字体库屏幕与字体/全局样式 REST 路由"

msgid "Block patterns and block directory"
msgstr "区块样板与区块目录"

msgid "Drop core block patterns, remote patterns and their REST routes"
msgstr "移除核心区块样板、远程样板及其 REST 路由"

msgid "Post revisions"
msgstr "文章修订版本"

msgid "Stop saving revisions and editor autosave snapshots for every post type"
msgstr "对所有文章类型停用修订版本与编辑器自动保存快照"

msgid "Revisions already in the database stay untouched; nothing consumes them on the contract API."
msgstr "数据库中已有的修订版本原样保留；契约 API 没有任何消费方。"

msgid "Pingbacks and trackbacks"
msgstr "Pingback 与 Trackback"

msgid "Disable the pingback/trackback protocols entirely"
msgstr "彻底禁用 pingback/trackback 协议"

msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emoji"

msgid "Remove the emoji detection script and staticization filters"
msgstr "移除 Emoji 检测脚本与静态化过滤器"

msgid "oEmbed discovery"
msgstr "oEmbed 探测"

msgid "Remove discovery links, the embed route and auto-embeds"
msgstr "移除探测链接、embed 路由与自动嵌入"

msgid "XML-RPC"
msgstr "XML-RPC"

msgid "Disable the XML-RPC server entirely"
msgstr "彻底禁用 XML-RPC 服务器"

msgid "Front-end head cleanup"
msgstr "前台 head 清理"

msgid "Strip generator, RSD, shortlink, REST hints and block CSS from front-end output"
msgstr "从前台输出中移除 generator、RSD、短链接、REST 提示与区块 CSS"

msgid "Native /wp/v2 REST API"
msgstr "WP 原生 REST API（/wp/v2）"

msgid "Answer 404 for the whole /wp/v2 API — only the aiya contract routes stay public"
msgstr "整个 /wp/v2 API 对无后台会话的访客返回 404——仅保留 aiya 契约路由公开"

msgid "The front end consumes aiya/core/v1 only, so the native API has no public consumer left and user enumeration goes with it. Sessions meeting the Security page's back-end minimum role keep the full /wp/v2 for admin screens such as the media picker — author level and above while that gate is off; signed-in sessions below the level are redirected to the front-end site."
msgstr "前端只消费 aiya/core/v1，原生 API 已无公开消费方，用户枚举也随之消失。达到「安全加固」页后台最低角色的会话保留完整 /wp/v2，供媒体选择器等管理界面使用——该门禁关闭时为作者及以上；登录态会话低于该级别时将被重定向到前台站点。"

msgid "XML sitemaps"
msgstr "XML 站点地图"

msgid "Answer 404 for wp-sitemap.xml and drop the robots.txt sitemap line"
msgstr "wp-sitemap.xml 整体返回 404，robots.txt 不再输出 Sitemap 行"

msgid "Feeds"
msgstr "Feed 订阅"

msgid "Answer 404 for every RSS/RDF/Atom feed URL"
msgstr "所有 RSS/RDF/Atom 订阅地址一律返回 404"

msgid "This screen is disabled because the site runs headless. Manage the setting under AIYA CMS Core > Optimization."
msgstr "该屏幕因站点以无头模式运行而禁用。请前往 AIYA CMS Core > Optimization 管理。"

msgid "Security hardening"
msgstr "安全加固"

msgid "REST route control"
msgstr "REST 路由控制"

msgid "REST cross-origin origins"
msgstr "REST 跨域来源"

msgid "Full front-end origins (scheme://host[:port]) allowed to call this API from the browser, comma-separated. Empty keeps every CORS header off — same-origin deployments need nothing here."
msgstr "允许从浏览器调用本 API 的完整前端来源（协议://主机[:端口]），逗号分隔。留空则完全不输出 CORS 头——同源部署无需配置。"

msgid "Login restrictions"
msgstr "登录限制"

msgid "Email-address logins"
msgstr "邮箱登录"

msgid "Only accept email addresses as the login field"
msgstr "登录字段仅接受邮箱地址"

msgid "Login page countdown gate"
msgstr "登录页倒计时门禁"

msgid "Show a countdown before the wp-login.php form becomes usable"
msgstr "倒计时结束后 wp-login.php 登录表单才可用"

msgid "The login form loads by itself after a short countdown; nothing to configure. Credential-stuffing requests that never wait out the countdown reach a page without a form, and the unlock parameter rotates by itself every 30 minutes."
msgstr "倒计时结束后登录表单自动出现，无需配置任何参数值。不等倒计时直接提交的撞库请求只会看到一张没有表单的页面，解锁参数每 30 分钟自动轮换。"

msgid "Admin protection"
msgstr "后台防护"

msgid "Admin back end minimum role"
msgstr "后台最低角色"

msgid "Users below the selected role are redirected to the front-end site. The same level unlocks the native /wp/v2 API for their sessions (see Optimization). Off by default."
msgstr "低于所选角色的用户将被重定向到前台站点。同一级别也会为其会话解锁原生 /wp/v2 API（见「优化」）。默认关闭。"

msgid "Subscriber and above"
msgstr "订阅者及以上"

msgid "Contributor and above"
msgstr "投稿者及以上"

msgid "Request URI guard"
msgstr "请求 URI 守卫"

msgid "Reject logged-out requests with oversized or probe-shaped URIs (414, REST routes excepted)"
msgstr "拒绝未登录状态下 URI 过长或形如探测的请求（414，REST 路由除外）"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载"

msgid "Deleting the plugin keeps all of its data — reinstalling picks up where it left off. The Plugins screen always asks before erasing; the switch below is the standing answer for WP-CLI and scripted uninstalls, and wiping cannot be undone."
msgstr "删除插件默认保留其全部数据，重装后可原样恢复。从插件列表删除时总会先询问；下方开关是 WP-CLI 与脚本化卸载的既定答案，清除操作不可撤销。"

msgid "Erase data on scripted uninstalls"
msgstr "脚本卸载时清除数据"

msgid "Wipe everything on WP-CLI / scripted uninstalls"
msgstr "WP-CLI / 脚本化卸载时清除全部数据"

msgid "Off (default) keeps the data. AIYA_CORE_UNINSTALL_PURGE = true in wp-config.php forces the wipe everywhere and skips the question."
msgstr "关闭（默认）保留数据。在 wp-config.php 定义 AIYA_CORE_UNINSTALL_PURGE = true 可强制所有路径直接清除并跳过询问。"

msgid "Please log in with your email address."
msgstr "请使用邮箱地址登录。"

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "登录"

msgid "This sign-in page opens automatically."
msgstr "登录页将自动打开。"

msgid "Please wait a moment — the sign-in form loads by itself."
msgstr "请稍候——登录表单会自行载入。"

msgid "Continue to the sign-in form"
msgstr "继续前往登录表单"

msgid "You are not allowed to edit this user."
msgstr "您无权编辑该用户。"

msgid "GoFile"
msgstr "GoFile"

msgid "Account token"
msgstr "账号令牌"

msgid "From the GoFile profile page. The account lists, folders and search endpoints work for any tier, but reading a folder needs Premium — without it every GoFile list reports that it needs Premium."
msgstr "取自 GoFile 个人资料页。账户、文件夹与搜索端点在任意档位都可调用，但读取文件夹需要高级版——没有高级版时每个 GoFile 列表都会报告需要高级版。"

msgid "Every five minutes"
msgstr "每 5 分钟"

msgid "Image processor"
msgstr "图像处理器"

msgid "Image"
msgstr "图像"

msgid "Image processing"
msgstr "图像处理"

msgid "Media library takeover"
msgstr "媒体库接管"

msgid "Run uploads through the image processor: scale, watermark, format conversion"
msgstr "上传时经过图像处理器：缩放、水印、格式转换"

msgid "WebP/AVIF saving requires the libwebp/libavif PHP libraries; unsupported targets fall back to the source format."
msgstr "保存 WebP/AVIF 需要 PHP 的 libwebp/libavif 库；不支持的目标格式会回退为源格式。"

msgid "Save format"
msgstr "保存格式"

msgid "Keep source format"
msgstr "保持源格式"

msgid "JPG"
msgstr "JPG"

msgid "WebP"
msgstr "WebP"

msgid "AVIF"
msgstr "AVIF"

msgid "Max image width"
msgstr "最大图片宽度"

msgid "Uploads wider than this are scaled down; 0 disables the limit."
msgstr "超过此宽度的上传会被缩小；0 表示不限制。"

msgid "Image quality"
msgstr "图像质量"

msgid "Save quality from 0 to 100; PNG maps it to the compression level."
msgstr "保存质量 0-100；PNG 会将其映射为压缩级别。"

msgid "Font file"
msgstr "字体文件"

msgid "Content URL, content-relative path or absolute path for cover titles and text watermarks. Leave empty to use the bundled font."
msgstr "封面标题与文字水印使用的字体：内容 URL、相对路径或绝对路径。留空使用内置字体。"

msgid "Watermark"
msgstr "水印"

msgid "Watermark mode"
msgstr "水印模式"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "禁用"

msgid "Watermark position"
msgstr "水印位置"

msgid "Center"
msgstr "居中"

msgid "Center left"
msgstr "中部居左"

msgid "Center right"
msgstr "中部居右"

msgid "Center top"
msgstr "顶部居中"

msgid "Center bottom"
msgstr "底部居中"

msgid "Top right"
msgstr "右上"

msgid "Top left"
msgstr "左上"

msgid "Top center"
msgstr "顶部居中"

msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "右下"

msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "左下"

msgid "Bottom center"
msgstr "底部居中"

msgid "Watermark image"
msgstr "水印图片"

msgid "Media library attachment used in image mode; its own alpha is kept as-is."
msgstr "图片模式使用的媒体库附件；保留其自身透明度。"

msgid "Watermark text"
msgstr "水印文字"

msgid "Watermark font size"
msgstr "水印字号"

msgid "Watermark opacity (text)"
msgstr "水印不透明度（文字）"

msgid "0 = fully transparent, 100 = fully opaque; applies to the text watermark only."
msgstr "0 = 全透明，100 = 不透明；仅对文字水印生效。"

msgid "Image processing failed; the upload was cancelled."
msgstr "图像处理失败，上传已取消。"

msgid "OpenList service"
msgstr "OpenList 服务"

msgid "Server URL"
msgstr "服务器地址"

msgid "Base address of the OpenList instance that hosts the listed files."
msgstr "承载所列文件的 OpenList 实例地址。"

msgid "Link base URL"
msgstr "外链地址"

msgid "Base address the delivery links are built on — the one the visitor's browser must reach. Leave empty to reuse the server URL; split them when WordPress reaches the file service on an internal host."
msgstr "下载链接使用的基地址——必须是访客浏览器能访问的地址。留空时复用服务地址；当 WordPress 在容器内网访问文件服务时，两者需要分开填写。"

msgid "API username"
msgstr "API 用户名"

msgid "API password"
msgstr "API 密码"

msgid "Used to fetch fresh bearer tokens; stored server-side and never exposed."
msgstr "用于获取新的 Bearer 令牌；仅存于服务端，绝不外泄。"

msgid "Token cache (hours)"
msgstr "令牌缓存（小时）"

msgid "0 refetches the token on every request. Uses the object cache, so a Redis/memcached drop-in makes it persist."
msgstr "0 表示每次请求都重新获取令牌。使用对象缓存，装上 Redis/memcached drop-in 即可持久化。"

msgid "Download link mode"
msgstr "下载链接模式"

msgid "How a delivery link is built. All three are download paths on the OpenList host — none of them sends a reader to its browsing pages."
msgstr "链接的拼接方式。三档都是 OpenList 主机上的下载路径，都不会把读者送到它的浏览页面。"

msgid "Direct (/d/)"
msgstr "直连（/d/）"

msgid "Proxied (/p/)"
msgstr "代理（/p/）"

msgid "Plain path"
msgstr "纯路径"

msgid "A value is required."
msgstr "此项必填。"

msgid "The minimum value is %s."
msgstr "最小值为 %s。"

msgid "The maximum value is %s."
msgstr "最大值为 %s。"

msgid "Enter a valid email address."
msgstr "请输入有效的邮箱地址。"

msgid "Enter a valid URL."
msgstr "请输入有效的 URL。"

msgid "Select a valid media attachment."
msgstr "请选择有效的媒体附件。"

msgid "Select a valid option."
msgstr "请选择有效选项。"

msgid "Delete AIYA CMS Core"
msgstr "删除 AIYA CMS Core"

msgid "WordPress is about to delete the plugin files. Before that happens, choose what to do with the data the plugin wrote."
msgstr "WordPress 即将删除插件文件。在此之前，请先确认插件写入的数据如何处理。"

msgid "Keep the data"
msgstr "保留数据"

msgid "Deletes only the plugin files. The plugin tables, aiya_core_* settings, meta fields and scheduled events survive, so reinstalling picks up where it left off — the safe answer for plugin updates."
msgstr "只删除插件文件。插件数据表、aiya_core_* 设置、元数据与定时任务全部保留，重装后自动接回原状态——插件更新场景的安全选择。"

msgid "Delete plugin only, keep the data"
msgstr "仅删除插件，保留数据"

msgid "Erase everything"
msgstr "全部清除"

msgid "Also drops the plugin tables (favorites, follows, auth tokens, notifications, credits, memberships, redeem codes, payment orders, stats, discussions) plus the aiya_core_* options, meta residue, transients and scheduled events. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "同时删除插件数据表（收藏、关注、认证令牌、通知、积分、会员、兑换码、支付流水、运营统计、社区）以及 aiya_core_* 设置、元数据残留、瞬时数据与定时任务。此操作不可恢复。"

msgid "Delete plugin and erase all data"
msgstr "删除插件并清除全部数据"

msgid "Kept either way:"
msgstr "两种选择均保留："

msgid "uploaded media and the wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ tree (generated covers and avatars), and the pic-bed pool."
msgstr "上传的媒体文件与 wp-content/aiya_thumbnail/ 目录（生成的封面与头像），以及图床文件池。"

msgid "Heavy dependency directories such as vendor/ are moved aside instantly so the deletion never blocks, and a daily cleanup cron removes the staged copy from wp-content/upgrade/ afterwards."
msgstr "vendor/ 等大型依赖目录会被瞬时移出、避免删除过程长时间阻塞，稍后由每日清理任务从 wp-content/upgrade/ 中移除暂存副本。"

msgid "Cancel, back to the plugin list"
msgstr "取消，返回插件列表"

